{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36450","headline":"鹦鹉咏 · 罗邺","name":"鹦鹉咏","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"玉槛瑶轩任所依，东风休忆岭头归。\n金[笼]共惜好毛羽，红觜莫教多是非。\n便向郄堂夸饮啄，还应祢笔发光辉。\n乘时得路何须贵，燕雀鸾凤各有机。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"罗邺","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36450.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36450","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}